something that could be done very quickly. So you lift the screen on each of these three patches. And first of all, you scan the QR code with a smartphone. And that brings you to a little survey on your phone. You lift the patches, you smell each one, and you tell us which one has the strongest odor. Because the glue has a little bit of odor. We're trying to work on that.

